// GPDK045 native Cadence adaptation; NOT a performance-matched paper reproduction.
// Missing device sizes/values use recorded defaults; see plan.json and classification CSV.
// Explicit body nets, including deliberately floating bodies, are preserved.
// PDK_BULK_N/PDK_BULK_P, where present, require an external bulk bias.
// Evidence: /projects/2022B4AA1300P/SchematicGeneration/Papers_dataset/consolidated_paper_dataset_final_locked/agnibha_mixed_pdk_20261008/cases/p07_proposed_ota
// Original comments below describe the pre-conversion topology:
// original: Manually traced from batch1/images/p07_proposed_ota.png, 2026-10-01.
// original: Topology-only golden netlist; not a native Cadence export or simulation deck.
// original: MOS pin order D G S B. All 26 body loops connect to their own source.
// original: User confirmed: sideways triangles are ground; input-source upper ends and
// original: the shared VN return remain floating. Undotted crossings are separate.
// original: Repeated R1/C1 and VP/VN value labels do not merge otherwise separate wires.
// original: Voltage-source order is + then -. The sine-wave sources have no marked
// original: polarity; top-to-bottom ordering is a convention, not a simulation claim.
// original: Main differential stage; common-mode feedback drives M4/M5 gates.
// original: Left folded branch: top mirror gates follow NL_BIAS, not VP_L.
// original: Right folded branch: top mirror gates follow NR_BIAS, not VP_R.
// original: Output-average sensing and common-mode stage.
// original: Source symbols retained, including their drawn polarity and open returns.
simulator lang=spectre
global 0
include "/linuxeda_new/c2scadence/FOUNDRY/analog/45nm/models/spectre/gpdk045.scs" section=tt

